WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:01,560
Wrong place again

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,560
I want to discuss a deal

3
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,560
This Richard Miller

4
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,560
More than 1.2 million

5
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:07,560
In exchange for the food you collect in the future, share it with us, Sister Fei

6
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,560
Don't waste it by giving it to him

7
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,560
You must have some people who can only draw cakes and have brains

8
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,560
At least I got what I can deliver now.

9
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,560
so you agree

10
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,560
I mean

11
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:16,560
You can go away

12
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:18,910
Use your few brains

13
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,910
What can this show bring me now?

14
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:21,910
Let me eat pheasant

15
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:22,910
It saves me from having to look for water

16
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,910
You can still ward off wild boars for me

17
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:25,910
a broken watch

18
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:26,910
It's useless even if I use it to smash coconuts.

19
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:27,910
Do you still want to trade it for me later?

20
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:28,910
All food shared

21
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:29,910
Have you been in trouble lately?

22
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:30,910
I drank too little and my brain is a little confused.

23
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:32,910
Du Che, stop pretending here.

24
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:33,910
More than 1 million thanks to you

25
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:34,910
Can you afford it in your lifetime?

26
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:35,910
Bringing you along is all a compliment to you

27
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:36,910
1.2 million is money outside

28
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:37,910
here it is

29
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:38,910
A piece of iron that can walk freely

30
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,910
You care about it. You sleep with it in your arms.

31
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:41,910
Now get a bottle of water

32
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:42,910
And this confession is in front of me

33
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,910
I choose water. I choose chicken legs.

34
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:45,910
What are you doing?
